Wi-Fi CSI Kids Lab — license overview / ライセンスの概要

This repository uses two licenses (dual licensing):

  Code  (src/, tests/, scripts/, firmware/, lab.py, start.*, notebook code cells)
        -> MIT License                       see LICENSE-CODE
  Documents (Markdown pages, notebook Markdown cells)
        -> Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC BY 4.0)
                                             see LICENSE-DOCS

You may use, copy and adapt both, also in schools and for free-research reports,
as long as you keep the copyright notice (code) or give credit (documents).

